WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.360
The Paper Tools page on pictotree.eu

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.120
allows you to export pictograms into

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.040
PDF format for easy printing.

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.599
To get started, you first add

5
00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:13.400
pictograms to the list

6
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.759
at the bottom of the screen.

7
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.399
You can easily reorder the list,

8
00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:28.760
delete items, or customize

9
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.679
the text labels on each pictogram.

10
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.359
For printing layouts, you have

11
00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:47.839
several options available,

12
00:00:47.879 --> 00:00:49.999
mainly two:

13
00:00:50.039 --> 00:00:52.120
Grid, which lets you print as many

14
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.999
pictograms as possible in your desired quantities

15
00:00:55.039 --> 00:00:58.080
for laminating and cutting out,

16
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.800
and Linked List, which you can arrange

17
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.440
either vertically

18
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:09.485
or horizontally.

19
00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.439
All that remains is to export your

20
00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:18.360
pictograms to PDF and print them out!
